{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/215671-dtf-devil-s-light","id":215671,"title":"[DtF] Devil's light","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-01T01:39:15-07:00","id":215671,"title":"[DtF] Devil's light","content":"Is the light Devils produce with various lores a sunlight or not? Fluff talks a lot about Devils being the makers of the sun and stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2347-mahasamatman","name":"Mahasamatman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2347_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T07:26:45-07:00","id":215831,"title":"","content":"Given that they created the world (and associated celestial bodies), I imagine it's real sunlight (unless it's identified as &quot;illusion&quot; or &quot;illusory&quot;).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/426-big-brother","name":"Big Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T07:35:05-07:00","id":215842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Big Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/215671-dtf-devil-s-light?p=215831#post215831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that they created the world (and associated celestial bodies), I imagine it's real sunlight (unless it's identified as &quot;illusion&quot; or &quot;illusory&quot;).</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Real sunlight&quot; is the sunlight that does aggravated damage to vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2347-mahasamatman","name":"Mahasamatman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2347_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T07:29:51-07:00","id":216747,"title":"","content":"I would make real sunlight an Apocylptic visage for the Fallen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T02:52:24-07:00","id":217269,"title":"","content":"Nor do the Devils nor their apocalyptic force create something called sunlight. They procude flames, okay, they procude even white sacred faith flames which deal aggravated dmg. But there is no sunlight. It would be mentioned.<br /> <br /> And it is, in Houses of the Fallen where Neberu have ritual called Dawn's Light and it does, what it says, even in the middle of the night. And yes, it turns vampires to ashes, but still powerful, long ritual. That's the proof the creators didn't want to give them such an overpower just by turning apocalyptic form, boom, vampire gone. But still Setites weakness about normal light would naturally be awoken by Neberu powers and forms.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3612-lunar","name":"Lunar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3612_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}